## PROJECT OVERVIEW

The Chrome extension should be positioned as universal search over all user data, specifically AI work and captured context from sources like ChatGPT, Claude, and web pages. The extension's primary function is to capture, normalize, and sync data, while the app focuses on search, filter, inspect, and reuse functionalities. Exporting becomes a secondary action within this framework.

